### billing-service's gRPC port is no longer published to the host.
### To call it from here, temporarily add `- "9001:9001"` under billing-service
### `ports:` in docker-compose.yml and run `docker compose up -d billing-service`.
GRPC localhost:9001/BillingService/CreateBillingAccount

{
  "patientId": "12333",
  "name" : "John Doe",
  "email" : "john.doe@example.com"
}
